findings.comment:
(REPEAT x2) 6-501.11: PHYSICAL FACILITIES shall be maintained in good repair.

The following concerns should be addressed:
1) Replace damaged ceiling tiles in the main floor and in the hallway behind the walk in cooler; 
2) The triple sink will be used as the mop sink. See that the ceiling tiles are made smooth and easily cleanable - remove the acoustic tiles AND seal the floor to wall with cove base; 
3) caulk hand sink to wall in the bathroom;
4) clean floor and repair the tile in-front of the cooler where the floor drain pipe enters;
5) seal holes in ceiling and wall by the milk cooler;
6) seal wall behind the triple sink.
